  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 67c1ea06341e35a4c9fe2e08745882cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: MowseDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcID: Mowse
  npcName: Mowse
  FirstTimeDialogue:
  - 'First time out? '
  - Hope it goes well.
  - Mice who leave never seem to come back...
  ReturnedDialogue:
  - 'I thought you where gone for good, '
  - ' glad you made it.'
  - Going back out?
  - Should I say 'see you soon'?
  - I suppose only time will tell...
  ThirdDialogue:
  - 'How many times have you left? '
  - ' Three? Four?'
  - Keep thinking you will never come back, but you always do.
  LastLevelDialogue:
  - 'Heard that this might be your last trip? '
  - 'Hope you save the last little guy. '
  AllLevelsCompleted:
  - You have freed all the mice!!!
